<h1>Build business-hours routing with VoiceML.</h1>
<p class="lede">Dunder Mifflin&rsquo;s Scranton branch is a fictional paper company that answers its phone from 9 to 5 on weekdays. Calls in those hours ring reception; calls after hours, on weekends, and on holidays hear why the office is closed and when it opens. The whole schedule is one document published on voiceml.org, with no application server.</p>
