<section class="section-block">
	<h2>Limits of this design</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Moving holidays need a yearly update.</strong> The document lists Memorial Day, Labor Day, and Thanksgiving for 2026 and 2027. Add each new year&rsquo;s dates, and any weekday a weekend holiday is observed on, then publish again.</li>
		<li><strong>Every change is a new document.</strong> Published documents can&rsquo;t be edited, so a new holiday or new hours means publishing again and pointing the number at the new URL.</li>
		<li><strong>The time is read once, when the call arrives.</strong> A caller who is still on hold at closing time stays connected.</li>
		<li><strong>Closed callers can&rsquo;t leave a message.</strong> To take voicemail after hours, add a <code>&lt;Record&gt;</code> to the closed branches, as the <a href="/support/voiceml/build-a-pbx-with-voiceml/">PBX example</a> does.</li>
	</ul>
</section>

